{"id": "b9656f601d0d6addcd5a5a81e7ab8701", "text": "that overeating leads to bodily discomfort. Similarly, oversleeping leads to \nlaziness and lethargy. Neit her of these conditions are conducive for \nmeditation. Likewise, one should not unnecessarily indulge in difficult, \nstrict fasting (as some do to reduce weight) as this can also have health \nconsequences. Basically, one needs to observe moderation in eating and \nsleeping. However, those who are in good physical condition, should not \navoid fasting on special days such as Ekadashi .", "embedding": [0.05453960970044136, 0.06593585759401321, 0.08577651530504227, 0.10315874963998795, -0.004000116139650345, 0.04082436114549637, -0.017678508535027504, -0.05207385867834091, -0.043242212384939194, -0.06191427260637283, 0.01247398555278778, -0.04396777227520943, -0.07204236835241318, -0.059469614177942276, 0.04764924570918083, -0.09503544121980667, 0.07999861240386963, 0.04506940394639969, -0.02689903974533081, 0.015340751968324184, 0.04672703146934509, -0.012603594921529293, 0.07947073876857758, 0.06798621267080307, -0.011476699262857437, -0.06724289059638977, 0.05173596367239952, -0.09922986477613449, 0.031543176621198654, -0.01784326881170273, -0.060320667922496796, 0.010621229186654091, -0.023364558815956116, -0.011857878416776657, -0.001575312577188015, 0.047523900866508484, 0.07867319136857986, 0.02990819700062275, -0.07094796001911163, -0.02503705583512783, 0.028593072667717934, -0.06653183698654175, -0.03499261289834976, -0.06814935803413391, -0.10062416642904282, -0.025707224383950233, -0.034097738564014435, -0.04752099886536598, -0.012901119887828827, 0.01011089887470007, -0.07632482796907425, -6.854176899651065e-05, -0.07662522047758102, -0.0074110194109380245, 0.09228694438934326, -0.050942521542310715, -0.005454494152218103, 0.062253519892692566, 0.023123502731323242, -0.010617335326969624, -0.04217129573225975, 0.043827854096889496, 0.04862518981099129, -0.03386964648962021, 0.006124376785010099, -0